<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><ncx xmlns="http://www.daisy.org/z3986/2005/ncx/" version="2005-1" xml:lang="en"><head><meta name="dtb:uid" content="urn:uuid:b74c31e1-9c16-48d3-9828-8aab8c9e04a7"/><meta name="dtb:depth" content="2"/><meta name="dtb:totalPageCount" content="0"/><meta name="dtb:maxPageNumber" content="0"/></head><docTitle><text>When AI Asks You to Pay</text></docTitle><navMap><navPoint id="nav-1" playOrder="1"><navLabel><text>Introduction: Before the message, there is a record</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch001.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-2" playOrder="2"><navLabel><text>1. Who decides the next step?</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml"/><navPoint id="nav-3" playOrder="3"><navLabel><text>The sender may not own the debt</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-the-sender-may-not-own-the-debt"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-4" playOrder="4"><navLabel><text>A claim must be verifiable outside the interface</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-a-claim-must-be-verifiable-outside-the-interface"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-5" playOrder="5"><navLabel><text>Before the system speaks, it makes choices</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-before-the-system-speaks-it-makes-choices"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-6" playOrder="6"><navLabel><text>What does referral for judicial recovery actually mean?</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-what-does-referral-for-judicial-recovery-actually-mean"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-7" playOrder="7"><navLabel><text>Identifying an AI does not explain its decision</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-identifying-an-ai-does-not-explain-its-decision"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-8" playOrder="8"><navLabel><text>A correction has to reach the system taking action</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-a-correction-has-to-reach-the-system-taking-action"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-9" playOrder="9"><navLabel><text>Measuring whether the case was resolved</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-measuring-whether-the-case-was-resolved"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-10" playOrder="10"><navLabel><text>Method and limitations</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-method-and-limitations"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-11" playOrder="11"><navLabel><text>Sources and documents</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-sources-and-documents"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-12" playOrder="12"><navLabel><text>2. Examining the performance claims</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml"/><navPoint id="nav-13" playOrder="13"><navLabel><text>What sits behind a recovery claim</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-what-sits-behind-a-recovery-claim"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-14" playOrder="14"><navLabel><text>Keeping the starting population in view</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-keeping-the-starting-population-in-view"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-15" playOrder="15"><navLabel><text>Separating the model from the modernisation</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-separating-the-model-from-the-modernisation"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-16" playOrder="16"><navLabel><text>Field experiments follow the money beyond the handover</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-field-experiments-follow-the-money-beyond-the-handover"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-17" playOrder="17"><navLabel><text>Examining PAIR&apos;s claim about emotional stress</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-examining-pairs-claim-about-emotional-stress"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-18" playOrder="18"><navLabel><text>Who never appears in the satisfaction score</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-who-never-appears-in-the-satisfaction-score"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-19" playOrder="19"><navLabel><text>What remains after the payment</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-what-remains-after-the-